WEBVTT

00:25.450 --> 00:26.640
Here's the lighttime!

00:26.730 --> 00:28.700
Will you guys click the follow button?

00:28.700 --> 00:29.220
Come on!

00:30.300 --> 00:31.660
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.330 --> 00:35.050
Follow us, please!

00:39.890 --> 00:41.430
Have you found Min Liu's phone?

00:42.060 --> 00:43.020
Not with him.

00:43.520 --> 00:45.330
Could it still be with Officer Chen?

00:47.800 --> 00:50.180
Just you wait. The reinforcements are coming.

00:50.440 --> 00:53.590
They are already here.

01:08.240 --> 01:13.340
Take the guy away. Leave the girl to me

01:14.650 --> 01:16.640
Cheng Xiaoshi, how's it going over there?

01:16.860 --> 01:17.770
Have you found the phone?

01:40.220 --> 01:42.010
Who are you?

01:42.310 --> 01:43.720
Come here to die?

01:45.840 --> 01:47.500
Ah, you're...

01:53.930 --> 01:55.100
3-star Warriors!

03:45.900 --> 03:49.020
(Episode 3 Two Funerals)

03:52.070 --> 03:57.000
Medical card, hospital admission certificate,
ID card, and payment receipt.

03:57.370 --> 03:58.480
All here.

03:58.480 --> 04:00.560
Dad, thank you for fetching us the stuff.

04:00.890 --> 04:02.270
Who's your dad.

04:05.070 --> 04:06.860
We used Dad's identity to get Lu Guang
admitted to the hospital.

04:07.170 --> 04:09.960
But what happened to
Qiao Ling and her friends on earth.

04:09.960 --> 04:14.810
I saw Lu Guang in the ward.
He seems to be badly injured.

04:15.540 --> 04:17.880
Fortunately, to look more like Lu Guang,

04:17.880 --> 04:20.980
Dad finally agreed to get a haircut and a shave.

04:21.070 --> 04:23.540
Dad does look much better after the makeover.

04:23.540 --> 04:24.220
Old fool,

04:25.030 --> 04:28.650
Get yourself a room here
if something's wrong with you. Otherwise, go home

04:29.050 --> 04:30.410
and make room for me.

04:31.700 --> 04:32.790
Do you hear me?

04:34.340 --> 04:36.640
Are you deaf or just can't understand my words?

04:36.850 --> 04:37.680
Get lost.

04:38.060 --> 04:39.580
It's been so late.

04:40.120 --> 04:45.260
You wanna live a nightlife like the young?
Get home and go to bed now.

04:45.410 --> 04:47.070
Why are you still sitting there?

04:47.160 --> 04:50.150
Young man, show some respect to the elderly.

04:50.860 --> 04:52.040
- Dad, he's drunk. Don't let him get to you.

04:52.040 --> 04:52.970
- Who's your Dad? Who's the elderly?
- Dad, he's drunk. Don't let him get to you.

04:52.970 --> 04:54.160
- Who's your Dad? Who's the elderly?

04:54.570 --> 04:54.700
- Fine, let's leave.

04:54.700 --> 04:56.480
- Well, well, let's go.
- Fine, let's leave.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.170
- Well, well, let's go.

05:00.290 --> 05:02.530
Three old fools grabbing seats in the late night.

05:03.370 --> 05:07.920
Doctor, nurse, help!

05:07.920 --> 05:10.050
I have alcohol poisoning.

05:11.570 --> 05:16.040
Help! I feel terrible.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.650
Oh my god, a snake!

05:24.780 --> 05:26.190
Take it easy.

05:26.190 --> 05:29.130
He's just a kid. Don't bother yourself.

05:29.130 --> 05:31.040
You mean I'm childish?

05:31.040 --> 05:33.340
Dad, that's not what I meant.

05:33.340 --> 05:35.040
Wait a moment.

05:35.620 --> 05:38.950
Before leaving, let me give Qiao Ling a call,

05:39.110 --> 05:40.470
to make sure we didn't miss anything.

05:48.060 --> 05:50.600
Strange. I can't get through.

05:50.760 --> 05:53.910
Ah! What's going on?

05:54.300 --> 05:57.560
Qiao Ling didn't answer.
Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang's lines are busy.

05:58.020 --> 05:59.520
I feel something's wrong.

05:59.810 --> 06:02.250
Should I return to the ward
and check the situation.

06:03.080 --> 06:04.730
I've just noticed

06:05.140 --> 06:07.970
some guys walking towards
the building behind us

06:08.290 --> 06:11.090
with a strong murderous look.

06:11.570 --> 06:13.460
Oh No! Let's hurry there.

06:13.460 --> 06:14.500
Wait!

06:14.640 --> 06:19.990
You forget what Qiao Ling has told you?
Hide yourself. Don't show your true identity.

06:19.990 --> 06:23.700
But we are in a hospital.
There's nothing to disguise myself.

06:32.830 --> 06:36.680
Just made it. Almost late due to the person
who showed the wrong direction.

06:38.440 --> 06:44.290
Role playing as superheroes? The 3-star and what?

06:44.290 --> 06:45.700
3-star Warriors.

06:45.700 --> 06:47.720
Right, right, 3-star Warriors.

06:49.290 --> 06:53.900
You remind me. The Star of Courage,
sweeping away the lightness.

06:55.920 --> 06:59.050
Hey, you two over there, leave right now.

06:59.390 --> 07:01.050
Ah, S...

07:04.050 --> 07:08.300
Hey, you sound a bit old.

07:08.700 --> 07:12.120
Are you from the local senior citizens club
or something?

07:12.150 --> 07:15.420
You're so old. Better go home and get some rest.

07:28.180 --> 07:28.410
- Dad, show some mercy.

07:28.410 --> 07:30.220
- Dad, don't use full power! What if he died?
- Dad, show some mercy.

07:30.220 --> 07:30.530
- Dad, don't use full power! What if he died?

07:30.530 --> 07:32.650
- What the hell are you?
- Dad, don't use full power! What if he died?

07:32.650 --> 07:33.620
- Dad, don't use full power! What if he died?

07:33.620 --> 07:36.620
Quite true. We're here to save people, not to kill.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.060
Right, right.

07:39.320 --> 07:42.370
Just three old fools, follow me!

07:48.850 --> 07:50.970
A moment's tolerance,

07:50.970 --> 07:52.840
for a beautiful world.

08:06.640 --> 08:09.730
Stop pretending and tell me all the truth.

08:10.620 --> 08:15.160
Sir, I really don't know anything.

08:15.160 --> 08:19.090
Look at yourself. Still trying to say
you can't remember who did it?

08:19.450 --> 08:20.240
You think me mad?

08:20.240 --> 08:26.860
I just saw a flash of white light,
and then I passed out.

08:26.860 --> 08:32.490
It was light. I saw it,
and then I was on the ground.

08:32.490 --> 08:35.340
Yes, yes, I saw the light too.

08:35.340 --> 08:39.080
My body seemed
so light that I could float in the sky,

08:39.080 --> 08:41.450
Was this the out-of-body experience?

08:41.450 --> 08:42.640
Are you trying to tell me

08:43.010 --> 08:44.410
that you were beaten by the Ultraman?

08:45.400 --> 08:46.750
No, no

08:47.290 --> 08:50.500
I remember now. It was the 3-star Warriors.

08:51.010 --> 08:53.110
The 3-star Warriors beat us up.

08:53.110 --> 08:54.520
They all have some
interrogation resistance techniques.

08:55.050 --> 08:56.660
I suppose they are not simple.

08:57.680 --> 08:59.490
It's a pity you were not present.

08:59.490 --> 09:02.080
I'd say the God of War came to the earth.

09:02.440 --> 09:03.380
Good to see you both okay.

09:03.380 --> 09:05.200
There are a lot of people watching, don't worry.

09:05.460 --> 09:07.200
Lu Guang, how's it going there?

09:07.320 --> 09:08.930
The security measures here
are also strengthened.

09:08.930 --> 09:11.130
There are police officers
patrolling nearby all the time.

09:11.920 --> 09:14.290
Moreover, to prevent their identities
from being traced again,

09:14.580 --> 09:16.780
a new group of people
will be sent in after a period of time.

09:17.170 --> 09:20.990
There are at least two people present
at all times to monitor each other.

09:21.620 --> 09:24.140
I think Captain Xiao is trying to deal with
the situation when someone's controlled.

09:24.140 --> 09:26.380
In this way, the other two can respond promptly.

09:28.340 --> 09:32.520
Too many things happened these days.
I'm a little tired. A nap would be nice.

09:33.560 --> 09:37.580
Any police officer outside while you're asleep?
I suggest you lock the door.

09:38.700 --> 09:40.760
But what if you're controlled?

09:41.490 --> 09:43.020
It's not safe to be alone in the ward.

09:43.390 --> 09:45.600
How about handcuffing yourself
to the bed before sleep?

09:56.210 --> 09:58.430
I feel that Lu Guang is a bit weird.

09:59.030 --> 10:02.860
He just had surgery and hasn't had a good rest.
Don't overthink it.

10:03.340 --> 10:05.960
You too. Let's find a place to take a nap later.

10:07.360 --> 10:09.730
Captain Xiao, what's going on with your head?

10:10.970 --> 10:13.160
I failed to control my emotions
when I saw Bin Chen.

10:13.840 --> 10:15.080
Someone hit me from behind.

10:15.080 --> 10:17.010
So, what about Officer Chen?

10:19.640 --> 10:21.930
Was Officer Chen attacked by those people?

10:22.360 --> 10:25.850
did they take Min Liu's phone?

10:25.850 --> 10:27.270
Min Liu's phone hasn't been found yet.

10:27.850 --> 10:30.090
But I must take full responsibility
for Bin Chen's death.

10:30.240 --> 10:32.550
It was due to my wrong decision
and improper plan.

10:44.590 --> 10:45.570
Officer Xiao,

10:46.060 --> 10:49.490
your intention to limit the scope of
information was to protect us.

10:50.040 --> 10:52.390
And to hide the special ability
that protects Lu Guang and me.

10:52.840 --> 10:57.020
After this case is over, I will apply for a voluntary
demotion and accept disciplinary action.

10:57.970 --> 11:01.260
But before that,
I will definitely find out all the truth.

11:02.250 --> 11:03.000
Count me in.

11:03.370 --> 11:06.770
Officer Chen, Emma, and so many innocent victims.

11:07.150 --> 11:08.980
We cannot let them die for nothing.

11:08.980 --> 11:09.180
Yes.

11:09.500 --> 11:11.680
I've reported some information about you
to the higher-ups.

11:12.570 --> 11:16.340
The situation is too special so it may take
some time for them to fully accept it.

11:17.710 --> 11:20.430
But now, we can't just sit around.

11:21.140 --> 11:23.180
Let's start with the main suspect
we caught this time.

11:24.770 --> 11:27.320
Your interrogation methods are quite unique.

11:28.160 --> 11:30.000
Is there some kind of special program?

11:32.720 --> 11:33.330
Watch your tongue.

11:34.480 --> 11:38.540
Captain Xiao, he hasn't said anything serious,
always joking around.

11:38.750 --> 11:40.880
Did you push Bin Chen off the roof?

11:41.330 --> 11:42.180
Me?

11:42.430 --> 11:44.540
He was a well-trained police officer.

11:44.750 --> 11:47.230
How could I, with my mediocre skills, handle him?

11:49.130 --> 11:50.910
In my opinion, he committed suicide.

11:51.710 --> 11:53.380
Any reason for you assumption?

11:53.750 --> 11:54.620
You saw it?

11:55.360 --> 11:56.740
Were you on the roof at that time?

11:59.430 --> 12:02.020
I just wanna get some fresh air on the rooftop.

12:02.020 --> 12:06.140
Unexpectedly,
I heard someone crying and yelling,

12:06.140 --> 12:09.000
saying sorry, over and over.

12:09.190 --> 12:12.860
When I went up to the rooftop,
I saw someone jumping down in a flash.

12:12.970 --> 12:14.960
I was so scared that I ran down quickly.

12:15.650 --> 12:19.230
What could make him feel so guilty like that?

12:20.220 --> 12:22.960
Couldn't it be that he took something
he shouldn't take?

12:23.120 --> 12:25.080
Shut up! Bin Chen was not that kind of person.

12:26.130 --> 12:28.470
Sir, please calm down.

12:28.640 --> 12:33.880
I didn't affirm anything. If you are so worked up,
people may think you're hiding the truth.

12:35.860 --> 12:37.500
Stop trying to frame me!

12:37.730 --> 12:40.010
We all know how tough Bin Chen's family is.

12:40.320 --> 12:46.290
Exactly, isn't it the reason why he took bribes?

12:47.160 --> 12:49.440
Just investigate it and you'll find out.

13:01.610 --> 13:03.900
He's dead, yet you still slander him.

13:03.900 --> 13:05.220
Captain Xiao, calm down.

13:06.270 --> 13:07.150
Asshole.

13:07.270 --> 13:09.880
I'll find the evidence to
prove Bin Chen's innocence.

13:17.340 --> 13:19.280
Yes, yes, I know.

13:20.460 --> 13:23.000
But Min Liu's suicide
must be related to Bin Chen's death.

13:23.700 --> 13:27.740
So when I solve the case, the money
found in Bin Chen's house will be explained.

13:29.150 --> 13:33.380
Those two children are special,
so please give them more time.

13:34.610 --> 13:34.970
OK.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.400
Okay, I understand.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.520
I'm not quite clear on these details either.

13:46.190 --> 13:48.080
I'll report everything together
once there are any developments.

13:48.410 --> 13:51.630
OK, thank you for understanding
and support. I'll hang up now.

13:54.140 --> 13:56.800
The incident with Lu Guang being stabbed
has been suspended by the higher-ups.

13:56.800 --> 13:58.470
They'll make a decision
after the whole case is closed.

13:59.370 --> 14:04.300
Thanks, Captain Xiao.
Lu Guang asked me to bring this flower.

14:04.610 --> 14:07.820
He planned to personally
say goodbye to Officer Chen, but...

14:08.020 --> 14:11.050
It should be fine if I push myself a bit.
Let me go, I…

14:11.660 --> 14:15.300
Ouyang Bubai, last time you got out of bed
without permission, your wound was reopened.

14:15.510 --> 14:18.470
Push yourself a bit?
You wanna have your intestines out?

14:19.680 --> 14:23.890
Will my intestines come out?

14:25.660 --> 14:29.600
Lu Guang's injury is no joke.
Your attendance is enough. Let him rest.

14:30.210 --> 14:33.440
Mr. Xiao, do we have any plan
for the follow-up investigation?

14:33.760 --> 14:35.120
What a coincidence.

14:35.290 --> 14:37.870
The memorial ceremonies
are held at the same time.

14:38.240 --> 14:41.440
Were you talking about investigation?
Is there any explanation for us now?

14:41.790 --> 14:44.380
A living person died in the interrogation room.

14:44.380 --> 14:46.870
And you told me that he strangled himself.

14:46.870 --> 14:48.580
Who would believe?

14:48.940 --> 14:51.600
Minmin didn't have depression
or other mental diseases.

14:51.600 --> 14:53.170
How could you say he committed suicide?

14:53.170 --> 14:53.840
Mr. Liu.

14:54.250 --> 14:58.410
There are other cases related with Min Liu.
You need to wait for us to make a clear investigation...

14:58.410 --> 15:00.740
Other cases? Any evidence?

15:01.240 --> 15:03.380
I would say that Minmin
is killed by your injustice.

15:03.380 --> 15:04.220
Please calm down.

15:04.770 --> 15:06.670
Our actions are all in accordance
with the laws and regulations.

15:07.240 --> 15:08.790
We will never direct against your son on purpose.

15:09.650 --> 15:10.200
Pooh!

15:10.890 --> 15:13.740
We caught him in the photo studio
owned by this young people.

15:13.740 --> 15:15.760
Yes, and he…

15:15.760 --> 15:16.730
I don't care.

15:17.030 --> 15:18.310
Now he's dead.

15:18.420 --> 15:20.300
Whatever you say, a dead person can't deny.

15:20.300 --> 15:22.900
Mr. Qian, can we apply for compensation?

15:23.290 --> 15:24.700
I can do it for you anytime.

15:25.550 --> 15:28.680
Qian Jin, you were also a policeman in the past.

15:29.080 --> 15:31.040
Now you are helping turn things upside down.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.440
Where's your conscience?

15:34.760 --> 15:38.520
Justice relies on evidence instead of assumptions.

15:41.140 --> 15:41.690
Qian Jin.

15:42.320 --> 15:44.820
You are a police officer,
and you can't act on impulse.

15:45.250 --> 15:46.330
Leave this case to me.

15:46.930 --> 15:49.660
I will definitely bring that bastard to justice.

15:54.360 --> 15:55.440
Do you hear me?

15:55.940 --> 15:57.810
If you can't get any evidence
after the investigation,

15:58.210 --> 15:59.300
be prepared for a lawyer's letter.

15:59.560 --> 16:01.070
The investigation will take some time.

16:01.070 --> 16:02.410
I can't wait any longer.

16:02.650 --> 16:05.200
Every day of delay is a day of injustice for my son.

16:05.390 --> 16:07.450
I was the witness
when he attacked others with a knife.

16:07.450 --> 16:08.270
I can testify.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.530
Oh boy...

16:09.840 --> 16:12.330
So you are the one talking nonsense.

16:13.000 --> 16:15.160
Min Liu is a disabled person.

16:15.290 --> 16:17.770
How did he manage to go to the photo studio?

16:18.270 --> 16:19.930
And even kill someone.

16:19.930 --> 16:21.290
How ridiculous.

16:21.410 --> 16:22.400
Mr. Qian.

16:22.560 --> 16:24.280
If they fabricate false evidence,

16:24.430 --> 16:26.400
can we ask for more compensation?

16:26.820 --> 16:29.030
The punishment of perjury
not only includes compensation,

16:29.250 --> 16:30.690
but also criminal responsibilities.

16:33.390 --> 16:35.920
Be careful, or you may not be able
to pay the compensation.

16:37.230 --> 16:39.860
It's not easy for you with a fixed salary.

16:40.210 --> 16:42.740
I heard that the young police officer took bribes.

16:42.740 --> 16:43.220
Shut up!

16:43.870 --> 16:44.890
There is no evidence!

16:45.060 --> 16:46.320
Don't spread rumors here!

16:46.730 --> 16:48.740
You can frame our Min Liu,

16:49.010 --> 16:51.110
but we can't even discuss what we heard?

16:51.210 --> 16:52.250
Moreover...

16:52.250 --> 16:53.700
No evidence?

16:53.910 --> 16:56.860
It's said that a sum of money with unknown sources
has been found in his house.

16:57.200 --> 16:59.320
Don't talk about this again.

16:59.480 --> 17:01.140
I refuse!

17:01.140 --> 17:03.300
I will even say it publicly, on live!

17:03.300 --> 17:05.230
What, you wanna hit me?

17:05.230 --> 17:07.220
Go ahead, hit me if you dare!

17:20.420 --> 17:22.569
Somebody! An attacker's here!

17:22.569 --> 17:24.450
Aren't you a policeman? Arrest him!

17:24.599 --> 17:26.569
He asked for it first.

17:28.420 --> 17:31.080
You brat, how can you do this for real!

17:31.560 --> 17:34.120
Your parents gave birth to you,
but forgot to teach you to be a man?

17:34.120 --> 17:35.600
Qian Jin, let him go.

17:35.600 --> 17:37.540
Apologize and I'll let you go.

17:46.300 --> 17:47.530
This is a real hit.

17:47.840 --> 17:49.390
He didn't even get hit once.

17:49.450 --> 17:50.320
Apologize for what?

17:50.560 --> 17:51.930
You're a landlady indeed.

17:52.120 --> 17:52.850
Good job!

17:54.600 --> 17:55.840
Who are you?

17:55.960 --> 17:58.480
Now she really hit him. Arrest her now!

17:59.270 --> 17:59.840
Are you OK?

18:00.260 --> 18:01.060
Qian Jin,

18:01.590 --> 18:02.180
what do you think?

18:02.580 --> 18:04.020
Hit by a little girl.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.550
Come with me to the station later

18:07.810 --> 18:08.710
and check your injuries.

18:09.890 --> 18:11.430
Just got scratched, not a big deal.

18:14.740 --> 18:16.490
You're just leaving after she hit someone?

18:17.680 --> 18:20.140
Well, well. It's not you who got hit.

18:20.760 --> 18:22.490
Better to avoid trouble, let's go.

18:35.960 --> 18:38.080
When was this photo taken?

18:38.450 --> 18:38.960
Oh.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.840
Two years ago when we got
our marriage certificates.

18:42.200 --> 18:42.690
What's wrong?

18:43.070 --> 18:44.910
Nothing.

18:45.350 --> 18:47.570
Time flies.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.280
It's been two years in a blink.

18:50.340 --> 18:51.950
We still haven't had our wedding.

19:01.840 --> 19:04.460
Where is Officer Chen's wife?

19:04.860 --> 19:07.010
I couldn't find her either.

19:07.280 --> 19:09.200
It's late. Where would she go?

19:09.760 --> 19:12.020
I hope nothing bad happened...

19:13.820 --> 19:16.850
Hmm, this music...

19:20.210 --> 19:20.880
Look!

19:58.280 --> 20:00.210
You jerk!

20:00.600 --> 20:05.900
You liar! Irresponsible bastard!

20:07.340 --> 20:07.950
Here.

20:09.120 --> 20:11.700
You finally have some time.
Why not have a meal at home?

20:12.410 --> 20:15.560
Hey, we'll have plenty of time
to stay home in the future.

20:16.770 --> 20:20.010
You haven't fulfilled any of your promises to me.

20:21.340 --> 20:24.580
Go shopping with me undisturbed.

20:25.410 --> 20:28.550
See a movie with me from beginning to end.

20:31.730 --> 20:33.620
So many nights,

20:35.140 --> 20:40.080
you told me that you would be back soon.

20:41.180 --> 20:43.240
It's so late. Still occupied?

20:43.240 --> 20:45.610
Almost done, be back soon.

20:47.440 --> 20:54.050
Then why aren't you back yet? Why?

20:55.290 --> 20:58.680
Why are you always breaking promises?

21:00.400 --> 21:02.960
If you can do none of these,

21:03.970 --> 21:06.680
can you promise me one last thing?

21:07.730 --> 21:09.420
All this you owe me,

21:10.740 --> 21:14.880
can you repay me in our next life?

21:15.660 --> 21:17.400
Yes, my lady.

21:47.530 --> 21:49.740
How's the farewell ceremony?

21:52.810 --> 21:56.010
Bin Chen and his wife are really pitiful,

21:59.820 --> 22:02.230
Lu Guang, I want to help them.

22:10.560 --> 22:12.490
OK, I understand.

22:19.690 --> 22:21.250
Hey, can you help me with this?

22:26.010 --> 22:28.200
Bin Chen, what are you looking for?

22:36.160 --> 22:36.900
This is...

22:38.490 --> 22:40.250
I, Bin Chen,

22:41.370 --> 22:47.240
am proposing to the love of my life
in all seriousness at this very moment.

22:48.160 --> 22:48.990
Sorry.

22:49.780 --> 22:51.400
I am often unable to accompany you.

22:52.320 --> 22:57.620
I always leave halfway during a movie
or have to work during shopping.

22:59.540 --> 23:03.620
But thank you for forgiving my frequent absences.

23:05.510 --> 23:10.640
I swear that I will love and
protect you for the rest of my life.

23:11.450 --> 23:19.320
No, not just this life. No matter in this life
or the next life, will you marry me?

23:24.800 --> 23:27.040
We've got the certificates. How can I say no?

23:28.010 --> 23:33.250
Also, you wanna propose only once
to ask for my next life? No way.

23:34.570 --> 23:38.100
In the next life, it'll depend on what you do.

24:02.820 --> 24:03.340
Wait!

24:17.240 --> 24:19.540
(I can't live without my good brother.)
